Create a workbook named sample_model.xlsx with:

Sheet: Inputs
A1 = Account
B1 = Activity
C1 = Quantity
B5 = Electricity
C5 = 100

Sheet: Factors
A1 = Factor
B1 = Unit
C1 = Emission Factor
C10 = 0.82
D1 = Other Factor
D10 = 1.5

Sheet: Parameters
A1 = Parameter
B1 = Some Parameter
B4 = 1000

Sheet: Embedded_Calculations
A1 = Account
B1 = Scope1
C1 = Scope2
D1 = Total
E1 = Emissions

B2 = =Inputs!B5*Factors!C10
C2 = =Inputs!C5*Factors!D10
D2 = =B2+C2
E2 = =D2*Parameters!B4

Then run:

excel-formula-extractor sample_model.xlsx

Expected formulas.csv will contain the original and resolved formulas.
